OL,3,GNEWSAIDF and colonel may feature in
OL,4,AGaza aid workers' inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scope of inquests into the deaths
OL,7,Fof three British aid workers killed by
OL,8,Fa drone strike in Gaza could be
OL,9,Fexpanded to include the Israel Defense
OL,10,FForces (IDF) and the commander who
OL,11,Fallegedly ordered the attack.
OL,13,FJames Kirby, 47, of Bristol, John
OL,14,FChapman, 57, of Poole, Dorset, and
OL,15,FJames "Jim" Henderson, 33, of Falmouth,
OL,16,FCornwall, died in the incident on 1
OL,17,FApril 2024.
OL,19,FThey were among seven World Central
OL,20,FKitchen (WCK) workers killed when a
OL,21,Fthree-car convoy was hit.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
