OL,3,GNEWSAIDF and colonel may feature in
OL,4,AGaza aid workers' inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a pre-inquest hearing at Avon
OL,7,FCoroner's Court, senior coroner Maria
OL,8,FVoisin confirmed she was "minded to
OL,9,Fgrant" the IDF and Colonel Nochi Mendel
OL,10,F"interested person" status. It is
OL,11,Fanticipated she will confirm her
OL,12,Fposition in writing.
